self.KB_CONTENT["card:756933"]={"id":"card:756933","ty":"card","sourceId":"756933","title":"『銷貨單建立作業』中的『INVOICE NO (TG040)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"銷貨單","keywords":["銷貨單","出貨","回寫"],"y":"other","answer":"* 若此張銷貨單是由出口系統更新過來，則出貨通知單上的L/C NO與INVOICE NO都會回寫。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:751327"]={"id":"card:751327","ty":"card","sourceId":"751327","title":"『現金流量表』中的『選擇金額單位』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"單位","keywords":["單位"],"y":"other","answer":"* 區分為1.元、2.千元及3.百萬元三種金額單位。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:750188"]={"id":"card:750188","ty":"card","sourceId":"750188","title":"『廠商帳齡分析表』中的『帳款截止日期 (C08)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"分析表","keywords":["分析表","應付","廠商","帳款"],"y":"other","answer":"* 預設系統日期。亦可修改，點選(icon)或[F2]日期快手查詢需列印應付帳款之截止日期。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:750434"]={"id":"card:750434","ty":"card","sourceId":"750434","title":"『應付憑單建立作業』中的『憑單日期 (ACP.TA003)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"應付憑單","keywords":["應付憑單"],"y":"other","answer":"* 指本張單據之確認日期。* 此欄位僅作顯示。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:750944"]={"id":"card:750944","ty":"card","sourceId":"750944","title":"『收款單建立作業』中的『 已結帳銷貨單查詢』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"銷貨單","keywords":["銷貨單","結帳單","客戶"],"y":"other","answer":"* 新增或修改狀況時，輸入客戶代號後若有修改權限者，可開窗查詢已結帳未結案的銷貨、結帳單資料。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
