self.KB_CONTENT["card:778182"]={"id":"card:778182","ty":"card","sourceId":"778182","title":"『製令指定完工作業』中的『選擇製令性質』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"製令","keywords":["製令","完工"],"y":"other","answer":"* 1.廠內製令、2.託外製令。* 預設值 '1.廠內製令'。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:777561"]={"id":"card:777561","ty":"card","sourceId":"777561","title":"『託外進貨異常表』中的『比價依據』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"製造命令","keywords":["製造命令","進貨","加工","計價"],"y":"other","answer":"* 計1.依製造命令單及2.依加工計價兩種。* 當溢價或低價為「Y」時，此欄位才可輸入。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
